@startuml

hide footbox

title US001 - To register a user in the system

actor Administrator
participant ":System" as System

' Human contact between Administrator and UI
activate Administrator
    Administrator -> System : **1** I want to register a user in the system

    activate System
    System -->> Administrator : **2** Provide username, contact and profile information for the User
    Administrator -> System : **3** For the new user (u1), here's the username, contact and profile information
    System -->> Administrator : **4** User has been registered in the system
    deactivate System

deactivate Administrator
@enduml